From de8962a9bcf838bfc16b8571f43449663d094194 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@local>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:10:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(opd2515): advance firmware boot to XNU handoff

Add the OPD2515 early screen checkpoints, persistent userdata-tail diagnostics, boot ramdisk recovery, and serial/status reporting used during bring-up.

Retry a payload driver rejected by a vendor Security2 path policy from a private memory buffer while preserving the platform authentication call. Add the iOS 16.5 profile and retain both XNU compile records required by archive builders.

Validated by the Windows EFI build and an on-device fastboot boot reaching DarwinBoot inputs-validated, ExitBootServices, kernel handoff, and XNU entry-probe stages 1 and 2.
