@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# UniXNU iOS 16.5 profile
+
+Target identity: iOS 16.5 (`20F66`), Darwin `22.5.0`, public XNU source
+`8796.121.2`, and Apple's `iPhone10,3` / D22AP device identity.
+
+The extracted kernelcache reports its internal kernel version as
+`xnu-8796.122.4`. The profile does not mislabel the public `.121.2` source as
+that internal build. The kernelcache is pinned separately by decompressed
+Mach-O SHA-256.
+
+The device repository owns the fully resolved 64-patch series and the prelink
+adapter needed to describe the Libm literal pool in this exact kernelcache.
